=== layout: two-panels

# Fly sex determination: extended ratios

@left

- [*X*]{underline=true}: X chromosome.
- [*A*]{underline=true}: one autosome set.
- 0.5: male; 1: female.
- 0.5 < X:A < 1: [*intersex*]{color=purple underline=true}.
- X:A > 1: [*metafemale*]{color=orange underline=true}.
- X:A < 0.5: [*metamale*]{color=green underline=true}.

@right

| Formula | Ratio | Outcome |
| --- | --- | --- |
| X:AAA | 0.33 | Metamale; low viability |
| X:AA | 0.5 | Male |
| XX:AAA | 0.67 | Intersex |
| X:A | 1 | Initially female; dies |
| XX:AA | 1 | Female |
| XXX:AA | 1.5 | Metafemale; low viability |

@notes

